<Base
  title="How Much Does Commercial Lighting Installation Cost in Tampa, FL? | Echelon Lighting"
  description="Commercial lighting installation in Tampa costs $3–$12 per sq ft. Full breakdown for warehouses, offices, and parking lots — plus TECO rebate details and permit requirements."
  schema={faqSchema}
>
  <div class="section py-12">
